            <ArticleTitle>Pain medicine specialists imaging the brain for pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This feature presents information for patients in a question and answer format. It is written to simulate actual questions that many pain patients ask and to provide answers in a context and language that most pain patients will comprehend. Issues addressed in this issue are pain medicine as a specialty and how the brain can be imaged for pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
